title: "The Geometry of Everything: Earn Your Reality · A Manual for Life"
abstract: >-
  Two hundred and forty teachings in twenty-six chapters, five Books and a
  Summit: the Ground of existence, the Light of consciousness, the Bond of
  relation, the Work by which you earn, and the Becoming by which you change,
  with the mathematics beneath them and an account of how the book could be
  wrong. Every claim is marked as a commitment, evidence or an analogy.
